<h2>DFP Media Manifest 0.2</h2>
<p><strong>DFP Media Manifest is now signed by DF Productions and checked by Apple, and it keeps itself up to date.</strong></p>
<ul><li>Check for Updates… in the menu bar menu looks for a new version; the app also checks once a day by itself.</li><li>Preferences &gt; Updates turns the daily check off, or lets updates install without a click.</li><li>An update restarts the app without asking whether another Mac should take over: it is back within seconds.</li></ul>]]></description>
